 "summary": "A platinum resistance thermometer element in an 0805 surface-mount body, made in Pt100 and Pt1000 values to the DIN EN 60751 curve with a 3850 ppm/K temperature coefficient. Tolerance classes F 0.3 (B) and F 0.6 (2B) both hold from -50 °C to +130 °C; on board material whose expansion matches the chip it may be run to +150 °C. It is supplied face up in blister reels for pick-and-place and reflow or wave soldering. 32207615 is the Pt1000, class F 0.3 (B) part.",
